- file_0_view_0: Grade (G), 'Daily Supply (kg)' (S_g), 'Cost (CNY/kg)' (C_g)
- file_1_view_0: Brand (B), 'Selling Price (CNY/kg)' (P_b), 'Blending Requirements' (L_{b,g}, U_{b,g} as above)[0m

